      "order": 6,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Sri Ramar\nThayaar: Sita Devi\nVimanam: Pushkala Vimnama\nPushkarani: Saryu Theertham\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumangai Azhwar: 1 pasuram\nNam Azhwar: 1 pasuram\nKulasekara Azhwar: 4 Pasurams\nPeriya Azhwar: 6 Pasurams\nThondaradipodi Azhwar: 1 pasuram\nTotal: 13 Pasurams",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
    },
